    {
      "id": "claim_9ceb770f923d4851a19b8909d85c64c6",
      "statement": "Action tools defend against stale short-lived positional IDs via optional validation fields (expectedText, expectedHref, expectedRole, expectedLabel) that return a stale_context error on mismatch, and via context versioning (pageContextId/visibleContextId) that surfaces page_navigated when the page changes; agents must re-read after navigation before reusing IDs (ADR 0036/0041).",
