      "statement": "Tool inputs are a cross-layer contract: changing tool inputs usually requires coordinated updates to servers/mcp/src/protocol.ts (envelope constructors and response parsers) and the shared background-controller.ts dispatch, plus the MCP tool file, page-actions.ts/page-context.ts, and websocket-client.ts request options; extension adapters must stay in sync with shared page-reader behavior and both Chrome and Safari must be updated for shared behavior.",
